      "product_summary": "High-top knit slip-on shoes with a ribbed sock-style collar and EVA sole. The lace-free front keeps the shape clean, while the tall opening distinguishes it from a low-cut sneaker. Black White and All Black provide contrast and monochrome choices through EU 35–45.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. serves international B2B buyers with footwear inquiries and order coordination. Product specifications and available options are confirmed for each selected style. Quantity, color and size requirements, packing, customization scope and lead time are reviewed before quotation."
